/S /H3
/T (Healthy aging refers to the process of maintaining physical, mental, and emotional well-being as we grow older. It involves adopting lifestyle habits that help preserve function, improve quality of life, reduce the risk of age-related diseases, and promote longevity.)
/E (Healthy aging refers to the process of maintaining physical, mental, and emotional well-being as we grow older. It involves adopting lifestyle habits that help preserve function, improve quality of life, reduce the risk of age-related diseases, and promote longevity.)
